The book you are looking for is called "Security".  It is part of the "System
and Network Management Documentation" sub-set
(http://tru64unix.compaq.com/faqs/publications/base_doc/DOCUMENTATION/V40D_HTML/AQ0R2DTE/TITLE.HTM). 
See section "6.4.1 Installing and Configuring Enhanced Security."

While it is not trivial, it is possible to enable Enhanced Security for
Authentication only (no ACLs or Auditing) and have longer passwords (up to 80
characters) and not have password expirations.

