You could use the Expect to do such task.

A simple Expect script would be:
_______________________________
#!/usr/local/bin/expect --

set user [lindex $argv 0]
set key  [lindex $argv 1]

spawn csh
expect %
send "passwd $user\r";
expect "New password:"
send "$key\r"
expect "Retype new password:"
send "$key\r"
expect %
--------------------------------

where you call your script like this: script_name <user_name> <password>



